## Regional Early Voting Sites

Here is the complete list of Regional Early Voting sites for the November 3, 2026, General Election.

Regional early voting sites will be open on Friday, October 30; Saturday, October 31; and Monday, November 2. Friday and Monday hours are 11 a.m. to 6 p.m., and Saturday hours are 9 a.m. to 3 p.m.

**Building Name****Address****City**

San Ramon Valley United Methodist Church 902 Danville Blvd Alamo
Oakley Recreation Center 1250 Ohara Ave Oakley
Pittsburg Library – Community Room 80 Power Ave Pittsburg
Richmond Memorial Auditorium 403 Civic Center Plaza Richmond
Center for Community Arts Auditorium 111 N Wiget Ln Walnut Creek

In-person voting is available in our office lobby beginning Monday, October 5, through Monday, November 2 during regular business hours (Monday through Friday, 8 a.m. to 5 p.m.) On Saturday, October 31, voting will be available from 9 a.m. to 3 p.m. On Election Day, voting will be available from 7 a.m. to 8 p.m.

